IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EVALPRGM.
AUTHOR.JU.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

   01 WS-AGE PIC 99 VALUE 25.
   01 WS-GENDER PIC X VALUE 'M'.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

   EVALUATE TRUE
         WHEN WS-AGE >= 18
            AND WS-GENDER = 'M'
               DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE MALE"
         WHEN WS-AGE >= 18
            AND WS-GENDER = 'F'
               DISPLAY "ELIGIBLE FEMALE"
         WHEN OTHER
               DISPLAY "NOT ELIGIBLE"
   END-EVALUATE

   STOP RUN.
